>>>>
FOLLOW: By using the response memory address (object identity) for deduplication, exact duplicate deliveries are safely ignored, but valid retries in the same round (which are new `ModelResponse` instances) properly append their `perf` score, allowing models to accurately escape the `UNDERPERFORM` state. No downstream breakage.

